dul:Task a owl:Class .
top:TimeInterval a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:TimeInterval .
dul:TimeInterval a owl:Class .
top:UnitOfMeasure a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:UnitOfMeasure .
dul:UnitOfMeasure a owl:Class .
top:Workflow a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:Workflow .
